# ADEPT EMD stage, part 2 (strain-step moduli), in batches. Runs modulus_files/in_<i>.elastic for
# i = first .. last, each into its own log (log.elastic_<i>); the wrapper joins them into log.elastic_T.
# Vars (set by run_emd_resumable): first last moddir
variable        i loop ${first} ${last}
label           snap
log             log.elastic_${i}
include         ${moddir}/in_${i}.elastic
log             log.emd_modulus append
print           "modulus snapshot ${i} finished"
next            i
jump            SELF snap
